flowchart TB
  A[proposed action, target] --> E{action = escalate?}
  E -->|yes| PASS[allowed]
  E -->|no| T{target investigated?}
  T -->|no, but mentions exactly one service| MAP[map to that service<br/>event target_normalized] --> T2
  T -->|no| BLOCK1[escalate · target never investigated]
  T -->|yes| T2{which action?}
  T2 -->|rollback| D{"a running deploy of target with<br/>0 ≤ opened_at − deployed ≤ 30 min?"}
  D -->|yes, or time unparseable| PASS
  D -->|no| BLOCK2[escalate · no recent deploy]
  T2 -->|increase_pool · restart · failover| P{"its precondition observed in the<br/>target's logs or metrics?<br/>(pool ≥ 20 · memory ≥ 300 MB · upstream 5xx/latency)"}
  P -->|yes| PASS
  P -->|no; runbook text doesn't count| BLOCK3[escalate · no precondition observed]
  T2 -->|scale_out| PASS
